STATEMENT OF OBJECTS AND REASONS
The Second National Commission on Labour, which submitted its report in June, 2002, had recommended that the existing set of labour laws should be broadly amalgamated into the following groups, namely:.—( a ) industrial relations;
( b ) wages;
( c ) social security;
( d ) safety; and
